  "statement": "Let $U$ be an affine open contained in the affine opens $V_i$, $V_j$ and\n$V_k$. The overlap isomorphisms of\n[def-nagata-global-blowup-overlap-basic-map] satisfy\n\n$$\n\\omega_{jk,U}\\circ\\omega_{ij,U}=\\omega_{ik,U}\\colon\n\\mathsf B_{V_i}(\\mathcal I)|_U\\longrightarrow\\mathsf B_{V_k}(\\mathcal I)|_U.\n$$",
  "proof": [
   {
    "text": "By definition,\n$\\omega_{jk,U}\\omega_{ij,U}=r_{V_k,U}r_{V_j,U}^{-1}r_{V_j,U}r_{V_i,U}^{-1}\n=r_{V_k,U}r_{V_i,U}^{-1}=\\omega_{ik,U}$.",
    "uses": [],
    "elementary": null
   }
  ],
